ser":"U8996GYBF","text":"ペアプロ（というか画面共有してもらっての作業）的なのをしていて、importを全部手で書いてたりしてめっちゃ大変そうなんだけどVSCodeの使い方分からないし、いちいち細かいところを指摘するのもあれだしで難しい","ts":"1632908360.420500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B587S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79f0040e-665d-4e5c-a97f-9f25431f2b25","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"自動で mkdir するやつもあるけど、適当に自分用のが欲しかったので。\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-makedir-for\u003e","ts":"1632890398.418900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"mattn/vim-makedir-for","id":1,"title":"mattn/vim-makedir-for","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"3","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVIp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a50def86-f6b6-460b-8a97-c03fcf7d1d06","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ふむふむ、なるほど","ts":"1632888939.418500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t/u"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *:undoj* *:undojoin* *E790*\n:undoj[oin]             以降の変更を直前の undo ブロックにつなげる。\n                        警告: 注意して使ってください。ユーザーが適切に変更を\n                        undo するのを妨げてしまうかもしれません。undo や redo\n                        の後でこのコマンドを使わないでください。\n \nこれは特に変更の途中でプロンプトを表示するような場合に便利です。例えば関数の中\nで |getchar()| を呼び出すなど。変更をつなげてしかるべき関連性のある変更がそこ\nにあることがわかっている場合に使ってください。\n \nこのコマンドは単独では機能しません。なぜなら、次のキー入力によって再び新しい変\n更が開始されるからです。しかし例えば次のように使うことはできます:  \n \n        :undojoin | delete\n \nこの後で \"u\" コマンドを実行すると delete コマンドとその直前の変更が undo され\nます。\n \n反対の動作、つまり変更を二つの undo ブロックに分けるには、挿入モードでCTRL-G u\nを使います。挿入コマンドを部分ごと (例えば文単位) に undo できるようにしたい場\n合に便利です。 |i_CTRL-G_u|\n'undolevels' の値を設定したときも undo は区切られます。新しい値と古い値が同じ\nでもそうなります。\n```","ts":"1632888902.418200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b89e9229-849c-4719-a4dd-8f4ec70c8d6a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":":help undojoin","ts":"1632888901.418100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GjDeN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"724e4351-95a1-44a2-9f05-13efe26b0c38","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"undojoin しています。（完璧ではないかもしれませんが、これもそれしか方法が思いつきません。）","ts":"1632888483.417700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JiX8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6bd0457-304f-4172-a65d-f561c293b567","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"アンドゥについてはどうしてます？","ts":"1632888401.417300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"InOAg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"447f3e9e-bd77-4c01-9375-91d2ee4e4f65","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど、やってみます","ts":"1632888391.417000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Q9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5190ada5-5d27-4716-89b7-0c526bc92395","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分は補完プラグイン側で、一時的にイベントを無視させてます。（これしかほうほうがない気がする）","ts":"1632888135.416600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d9G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df257390-d772-43f4-b3d2-b6e9276a108f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"やはりイベント飛びますよね、うーん","ts":"1632888062.415300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tot0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adfde624-cfac-4fe8-998a-9cd12bb7ff38","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"2個以上の補完ができない。","ts":"1632887320.414900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U7cT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e362448-cec4-46e4-8b68-c14fdd01ca6f","type":"message